      800   PROCEDURE update-doc-def :
      801   define input  parameter p-recid as recid     no-undo .
      802   define input  parameter p-list-obj as character no-undo .
      803   define input  parameter p-list-doc as character no-undo .
      804   define variable v-date as date no-undo .
